# Local/CI development env vars for Supabase Edge Functions served by `supabase start`.
# NEVER put a real production secret here — this file is committed to the repo.

# Shared server-to-server secret between the Member API and resolve-member-scope (P5.5-02), same
# pattern as CRON_SECRET (P3-08). This value is a local/CI-only placeholder with zero production
# meaning; the real value for a deployed environment is provisioned as an Edge Function secret
# (`supabase secrets set`), never committed.
MEMBER_SCOPE_RESOLVER_SECRET=local-dev-only-member-scope-secret-not-for-production
